---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of service" description="The terms that apply when you use the Artemi website and services.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="c-8 prose">
        <p class="mono muted">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of service</h1>
        <p class="mono muted">Last updated: <Placeholder note="terms last-updated date">9 November 2026</Placeholder></p>
        <Placeholder block note="terms full text (draft, needs legal review)">
          <p>These terms apply to your use of artemi.in and to any free resources we provide, such as the AI Visibility Report. Paid engagements are governed by a separate signed agreement.</p>
          <h2>Using this site</h2>
          <p>You may use this site for lawful purposes. Do not attempt to disrupt it, access it without authorisation, or copy its content for commercial use without permission.</p>
          <h2>Free reports</h2>
          <p>AI Visibility Reports are provided for information only. AI answers change often, and results reflect what we observed at the time of testing. We do not guarantee any ranking, citation or business outcome.</p>
          <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>Content on this site belongs to Artemi unless stated otherwise. Client names and marks belong to their owners and are shown with permission.</p>
          <h2>Liability</h2>
          <p>To the extent permitted by law, Artemi is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of this site or its free resources.</p>
          <h2>Changes</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date above shows when they last changed.</p>
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to Artemi through the contact details on this site.</p>
        </Placeholder>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal { padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px) 0 var(--section); }
  .legal h1 { margin: 16px 0 24px; }
</style>
